permission is granted to copy, modify, or distribute the source code or the built plugins.

Third-party components keep their own licenses and are fetched at build time, not vendored:
  - JUCE (https://juce.com): AGPLv3 or commercial license
  - VST3 SDK (bundled with JUCE): GPLv3 or Steinberg proprietary license
  - Catch2 (tests only): BSL-1.0

Distributing a closed-source plugin built with JUCE requires a JUCE commercial license and the
VST3 SDK license terms from Steinberg. Decide on licensing before any public release.
